OL,3,AMet to re-examine CCTV from Jill Dando
OL,4,Amurder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Police has confirmed it will
OL,7,Fre-examine CCTV footage relating to the
OL,8,Funsolved murder of Jill Dando, 27 years
OL,9,Fago.
OL,11,FThe BBC presenter and journalist was
OL,12,Fshot dead with a single bullet on her
OL,13,Fdoorstep in Fulham in April 1999.
OL,14,FDespite one of the biggest and most
OL,15,Fhigh-profile murder investigations in
OL,16,FBritish history, the case remains
OL,17,Funsolved.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
