OL,3,ARayner criticises visa rule proposals
OL,4,Aahead of Labour conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner has
OL,7,Fsaid she is concerned about Labour's
OL,8,Fproposals to change visa rules, which
OL,9,Fwould make it harder for foreign
OL,10,Fworkers to secure permanent residency
OL,11,Fin the UK.
OL,13,FIn an interview with the Times ahead of
OL,14,FLabour's annual conference, Rayner
OL,15,Fquestioned Home Secretary Shabana
OL,16,FMahmood's plans, saying they are unfair
OL,17,Fbecause they "change the goalposts".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
