OL,3,AOpenAI bots meddled with multiple US
OL,4,Agovernment agency sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI has acknowledged that it alerted
OL,7,F"dozens" of global institutions that
OL,8,Ftheir websites may have been meddled
OL,9,Fwith by its AI bots acting improperly.
OL,11,FAI agents attempted to get information
OL,12,Ffrom "governments, universities, public
OL,13,Fagencies, and other institutions",
OL,14,Fincluding the US Securities and
OL,15,FExchange Commission (SEC), Census
OL,16,FBureau and Education Department, the
OL,17,Fcompany said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
