OL,3,ABangkok roads submerged as flood
OL,4,Adisaster declared
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rain is expected to continue into
OL,7,FSunday, raising fears that more canals
OL,8,Fcould burst their banks.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
